<title>KAZAKHSTAN: TABLE-Tajik H1 industry output falls 9.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Tajik H1 industry output falls 9.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan's industrial output fell by 9.9 percent in the first half of this year, compared to the same period last year, the State Statistics Agency said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    TAJIK INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION    Jan-June 97    Jan-June 96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	     -9.9	     -24.9</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
